{"id": "c5630973-5624-4e16-acc7-5965bd5f8d12", "slug": "tactical-intelligence-platform", "title": "Tactical Intelligence Platform", "description": "Tactical Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Tactical Intelligence Platform\"\ndescription: \"Tactical Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#5EE7FF\"\n  secondary: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  accent: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  background: \"#020202\"\n  surface: \"#252936\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#252936\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"1px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Tactical Intelligence Platform\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 251; favorites: 16; remixes: 3.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nTactical Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nTactical Systems Intelligence Tactical Systems Intelligence Tactical Systems Intelligence Tactical Systems Intelligence Tactical Systems Intelligence System active • Awaiting inputs // BLOCK.01 OP_CORE Modular Matrix ^…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Tactical Systems Intelligence; Modular Matrix; Spatial Telemetry; Encrypted Datalink; Global Metrics.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #5EE7FF, secondary #8B5CF6, accent #8B5CF6, background #020202, surface #252936, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse JetBrains Mono for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Tactical Intelligence Platform</title>\n\n  <!-- Fonts -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #07080d;\n      --panel: rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.66);\n      --panel-strong: rgba(10, 13, 22, 0.84);\n      --line: #303746;\n      --line-soft: rgba(155, 174, 205, 0.16);\n      --muted: #7f8796;\n      --text: #f6f8fb;\n\n      --ion: #5ee7ff;\n      --ion-soft: #a8f3ff;\n      --violet: #8b5cf6;\n      --violet-soft: #c4b5fd;\n      --blue: #3b82f6;\n      --white-hot: #f8fbff;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background-color: var(--bg);\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.028) 1px, transparent 1px);\n      background-size: 40px 40px;\n      background-position: center top;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes scanline {\n      0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }\n      100% { transform: translateY(100vh); }\n    }\n\n    .scanline-overlay::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      height: 10vh;\n      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.045), transparent);\n      animation: scanline 8s linear infinite;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 50;\n    }\n\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n      box-shadow:\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055),\n        inset 0 0 40px rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.025),\n        0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.58);\n    }\n\n    .gradient-shell {\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        rgba(168, 243, 255, 0.24),\n        rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12),\n        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)\n      );\n    }\n\n    @keyframes pulse-opacity {\n      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.32; }\n      50% { opacity: 0.88; }\n    }\n\n    .animate-pulse-slow {\n      animation: pulse-opacity 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes graph-rise {\n      0% {\n        transform: scaleY(0.12);\n        opacity: 0.35;\n      }\n      55% {\n        transform: scaleY(1.08);\n        opacity: 1;\n      }\n      100% {\n        transform: scaleY(1);\n        opacity: 0.92;\n      }\n    }\n\n    .metric-bar {\n      transform-origin: bottom;\n      animation: graph-rise 1.35s cubic-bezier(.19, 1, .22, 1) both;\n    }\n\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.08s; }\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.18s; }\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.28s; }\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.38s; }\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.48s; }\n    .metric-bar:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.58s; }\n\n    @keyframes graph-scan {\n      0% { transform: translateX(-120%); opacity: 0; }\n      18% { opacity: 1; }\n      82% { opacity: 1; }\n      100% { transform: translateX(120%); opacity: 0; }\n    }\n\n    .graph-scan {\n      animation: graph-scan 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes status-fill {\n      0% { transform: scaleX(0.15); }\n      100% { transform: scaleX(1); }\n    }\n\n    .status-fill {\n      transform-origin: left;\n      animation: status-fill 1.4s cubic-bezier(.19, 1, .22, 1) both;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen scanline-overlay font-['JetBrains_Mono',_monospace]\">\n\n  <!-- Ambient glow at top center -->\n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[880px] h-[440px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[var(--ion)]/10 via-[var(--violet)]/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-[110px] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[76rem] mx-auto pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-24 px-5 md:px-8\">\n\n    <!-- Header / 3D Kinetic Scene -->\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-16 md:mb-20 h-[140px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-crosshair\">\n      <div class=\"scene relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-75 ease-out\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n        <h2 class=\"relative z-10 text-[2.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] font-medium text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(94,231,255,0.62)] uppercase\">\n          Tactical Systems <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> Intelligence\n        </h2>\n\n        <!-- Extrusion Shards -->\n        <span class=\"shard absolute z-0 text-[2.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] font-medium text-[#020202] uppercase pointer-events-none\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(94,231,255,0.38); transform: translate3d(0,0,-15px);\">\n          Tactical Systems <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> Intelligence\n        </span>\n\n        <span class=\"shard absolute -z-10 text-[2.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] font-medium text-[#020202] uppercase pointer-events-none\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(94,231,255,0.24); transform: translate3d(0,0,-30px);\">\n          Tactical Systems <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> Intelligence\n        </span>\n\n        <span class=\"shard absolute -z-20 text-[2.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] font-medium text-[#020202] uppercase pointer-events-none\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(139,92,246,0.22); transform: translate3d(0,0,-45px);\">\n          Tactical Systems <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> Intelligence\n        </span>\n\n        <span class=\"shard absolute -z-30 text-[2.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] font-medium text-[#020202] uppercase pointer-events-none\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(139,92,246,0.10); transform: translate3d(0,0,-60px);\">\n          Tactical Systems <br class=\"hidden md:block\"/> Intelligence\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--muted)] mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 font-medium\">\n        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[var(--ion)] rounded-full animate-pulse-slow shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(94,231,255,0.95)]\"></span>\n        System active • Awaiting inputs\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bento Grid -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6 md:h-[680px] lg:h-[760px]\">\n\n      <!-- Column 1 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-6 h-full\">\n\n        <!-- Block 01 -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[340px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(58%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden group\">\n\n            <!-- Reticles -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-l border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-r border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-l border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-r border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Top labeling -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8 z-10 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase font-semibold\">\n              <span>// BLOCK.01</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[var(--ion)]\">OP_CORE</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 class=\"text-[36px] font-medium text-white tracking-[-0.055em] uppercase z-10 leading-none\">\n              Modular <br> Matrix\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Animated Data Graph -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-8 bottom-8 top-32 flex flex-col justify-end gap-2 pointer-events-none opacity-90\">\n\n              <div class=\"relative flex items-end gap-1 h-full w-full opacity-90 overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"graph-scan absolute inset-y-0 w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--ion)]/12 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[#222832] h-[20%] relative\">\n                  <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-full h-px bg-[var(--silver-soft,#aeb7c2)]/60\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[var(--ion)]/18 h-[60%] border border-[var(--ion)]/40 relative shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(94,231,255,0.10)]\">\n                  <div class=\"absolute -top-4 text-[8px] text-[var(--ion)] w-full text-center\">^</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[#242733] h-[40%] relative\">\n                  <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-full h-px bg-[var(--muted)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[var(--violet)]/18 h-[80%] border border-[var(--violet)]/28 relative shadow-[0_0_22px_rgba(139,92,246,0.12)]\">\n                  <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-full h-px bg-[var(--violet-soft)]/70\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[#0b0d13] border border-[var(--line)] h-[50%] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                  <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[var(--ion)] animate-pulse-slow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(94,231,255,0.9)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"metric-bar w-1/6 bg-[#222832] h-[30%] relative\">\n                  <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-full h-px bg-[var(--muted)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] font-medium\">\n                <span>0x00</span>\n                <span>0xFF</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Handshake Protocol Card -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[190px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(42%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,transparent_45%,rgba(94,231,255,0.025)_50%,transparent_55%)] bg-[length:10px_10px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2 right-2 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[var(--ion)]/35\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n              <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--muted)] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-3 font-semibold\">\n                Handshake protocol\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5\">\n                <div class=\"border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-3\">\n                  <div class=\"text-[9px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] mb-1\">Node Sync</div>\n                  <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--ion-soft)] font-semibold\">98.7%</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-3\">\n                  <div class=\"text-[9px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] mb-1\">Key State</div>\n                  <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--violet-soft)] font-semibold\">VALID</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"relative z-10 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[var(--ion)] tracking-[1.2px] uppercase px-[32px] py-[12px] border border-[var(--ion)]/34 hover:bg-[var(--ion)]/10 hover:border-[var(--ion)] transition-all duration-300 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\">\n              Authenticate\n              <span class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-l border-[var(--ion)]\"></span>\n              <span class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-r border-[var(--ion)]\"></span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Column 2 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-6 h-full\">\n\n        <!-- Block 02 -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[420px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(68%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-8 flex flex-col items-center relative overflow-hidden group\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full z-10 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase mb-4 font-semibold\">\n              <span>// BLOCK.02</span>\n              <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:terminal-outline-linear\" class=\"text-[12px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                SCAN\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 class=\"text-[48px] font-medium text-white tracking-[-0.055em] uppercase z-10 text-center leading-[48px] mt-2\">\n              Spatial<br/>Telemetry\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Radar/Grid Visual -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 top-32 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none opacity-70\">\n              <div class=\"absolute w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-full border border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full border border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full border border-[var(--line)]\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--line)] to-transparent\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute h-full w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[var(--line)] to-transparent\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute w-8 h-8 border border-[var(--ion)] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(94,231,255,0.18)]\">\n                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[var(--ion)] shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(94,231,255,0.9)]\"></div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[20%] w-3 h-3 border border-[var(--violet)] rounded-sm\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] right-[30%] w-2 h-2 bg-[var(--ion)] rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(94,231,255,0.7)]\"></div>\n\n              <div class=\"absolute w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-full bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,transparent_70%,rgba(94,231,255,0.16)_100%)] origin-center animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-8 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] font-mono font-medium\">\n              <div>LAT: 42.3601 N</div>\n              <div>LNG: 71.0589 W</div>\n              <div class=\"text-[var(--ion)] mt-1\">LOCKED</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Encrypted Datalink -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[220px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(32%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-[var(--line)] m-2\"></div>\n\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-[var(--ion)] text-[24px] mb-3 drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(94,231,255,0.55)]\"></iconify-icon>\n\n            <h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold text-white mb-2 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase\">\n              Encrypted Datalink\n            </h3>\n\n            <p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#b8c0ce] leading-[16px] max-w-[280px] font-medium\">\n              Secure edge-processed vision systems with zero-retention architecture. Anonymous analytics enforced via hardware-level isolation.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Column 3 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-6 h-full\">\n\n        <!-- Block 03 -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[340px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(58%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden group\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full z-10 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase mb-4 font-semibold\">\n              <span>// BLOCK.03</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[var(--violet-soft)]\">SYS_DIAG</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full w-full z-10 relative\">\n\n              <!-- Data Visual -->\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col w-full gap-2 mb-8 mt-auto px-4 opacity-90\">\n                <div class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] w-8\">CPU</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 h-1 bg-[#252936] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"status-fill absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[84%] bg-[var(--ion)] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(94,231,255,0.45)]\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[var(--ion)] font-semibold\">84%</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] w-8\">MEM</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 h-1 bg-[#252936] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"status-fill absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[42%] bg-[var(--violet)] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(139,92,246,0.45)]\" style=\"animation-delay: .12s;\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[var(--violet-soft)] font-semibold\">42%</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] w-8\">NET</span>\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 h-1 bg-[#252936] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"status-fill absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[96%] bg-white shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.34)]\" style=\"animation-delay: .24s;\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white font-semibold\">96%</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <h3 class=\"text-[36px] font-medium text-white tracking-[-0.055em] uppercase text-center leading-[40px] mb-auto\">\n                Global<br/>Metrics\n              </h3>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Override Status Card -->\n        <div class=\"gradient-shell p-[1px] rounded-[2px] h-auto min-h-[190px] md:min-h-0 md:h-[calc(42%-12px)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass-panel w-full h-full rounded-[1px] p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent,transparent_2px,rgba(94,231,255,0.16)_2px,rgba(94,231,255,0.16)_4px)] opacity-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[var(--violet)]/35\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n              <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--muted)] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-3 font-semibold text-left\">\n                Override status\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5\">\n                <div class=\"border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-3\">\n                  <div class=\"text-[9px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] mb-1\">Authority</div>\n                  <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--ion-soft)] font-semibold\">LEVEL 04</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-3\">\n                  <div class=\"text-[9px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] mb-1\">Failover</div>\n                  <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--violet-soft)] font-semibold\">ARMED</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"relative w-full z-10 text-[12px] font-semibold text-white tracking-[1.2px] uppercase px-[24px] py-[12px] bg-transparent border border-white/12 hover:bg-[var(--ion)] hover:text-black hover:border-[var(--ion)] transition-all duration-300 text-center\">\n              Execute Diagnostic\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer Links Area -->\n    <div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-between items-center px-4 md:px-0\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[var(--ion)] tracking-[1.2px] uppercase hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\">\n        Protocols\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-white tracking-[1.2px] uppercase hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\">\n        Telemetry Base\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    // Kinetic Physics & Interaction Script\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const sceneContainer = document.querySelector('.scene');\n      const shards = document.querySelectorAll('.shard');\n\n      let mouseX = 0;\n      let mouseY = 0;\n      let currentX = 0;\n      let currentY = 0;\n      let targetSpread = 1;\n      let currentSpread = 1;\n\n      window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n        mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n        mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n      });\n\n      const headerArea = sceneContainer.parentElement;\n\n      headerArea.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n        targetSpread = 2.5;\n      });\n\n      headerArea.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n        targetSpread = 1;\n      });\n\n      headerArea.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        targetSpread = 5;\n\n        setTimeout(() => {\n          targetSpread = 2.5;\n        }, 150);\n      });\n\n      function animate() {\n        currentX += (mouseX * 15 - currentX) * 0.05;\n        currentY += (-mouseY * 15 - currentY) * 0.05;\n        currentSpread += (targetSpread - currentSpread) * 0.1;\n\n        sceneContainer.style.transform = `perspective(1200px) rotateX(${currentY}deg) rotateY(${currentX}deg)`;\n\n        shards.forEach((shard, index) => {\n          const baseZ = -(index + 1) * 15;\n          const z = baseZ * currentSpread;\n\n          shard.style.transform = `translate3d(0,0,${z}px)`;\n\n          if (currentSpread > 1.1) {\n            shard.style.opacity = Math.max(0.1, 1 - (index * 0.2));\n          } else {\n            shard.style.opacity = 1;\n          }\n        });\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n      }\n\n      animate();\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "tactical-intelligence-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/tactical-intelligence-platform.jpg", "source_name": "tactical-intelligence-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 342, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T14:15:01.367401+00:00"}